---
import '../styles/home-turntable.css';
import RetroTurntable from '../components/RetroTurntable.astro';
import PageTransitionHead from '../components/PageTransitionHead.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>谢擎宇｜产品体验设计师</title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#F7F7F4">
  <meta name="description" content="谢擎宇的产品体验设计作品集，包含已上线的低空智航运营平台、房产 GIS、AI 评审、品牌系统提案、执行网查询助手与粤见非遗小程序。">
  <PageTransitionHead />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="bar">
  <a class="bar__name" href="#main">谢擎宇</a>
</header>
<main class="stage" id="main" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="showcase">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 id="home-title">产品体验设计师</h1>
      <p class="intro__lead"><strong>我关注人们怎样在复杂业务中找到信息、完成任务。</strong>我先理清业务关系，再沿着实际任务重组界面，用交互原型和 AI 工作流检查操作和反馈。</p>
      <div class="intro__actions"><a class="resume" href="/resume/xie-qingyu-resume.pdf" download="谢擎宇-体验设计师简历.pdf">下载简历 · PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="mailto:second988@qq.com">second988@qq.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <RetroTurntable />
  </section>
  <div class="workstation">
  <section class="collection" id="selected-work" aria-label="作品唱片架">
    <p class="collection__hint"><span class="collection__hint-hover">悬停换片 · 点击看案例</span><span class="collection__hint-touch">点击封面，查看案例</span></p>
    <ul class="crate" aria-label="作品索引">
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/low-altitude-operations/" aria-describedby="work-summary-0" data-select="0" style="--disc: #8b64ad" aria-current="true" aria-controls="work-0" aria-label="打开低空智航运营平台案例">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/low-altitude-paper-pilot.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">01</span><span class="sleeve__title">低空智航运营平台<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-0"><span class="sleeve__type">多端产品 · 已上线</span><span class="sleeve__result">负责巡查平台三端界面与交互。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/real-estate-gis/" aria-describedby="work-summary-1" data-select="1" style="--disc: #ed5636" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-1" aria-label="打开房产 GIS 体验重构">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/gis-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">02</span><span class="sleeve__title">房产 GIS 体验重构<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-1"><span class="sleeve__type">B 端 · 回溯重构</span><span class="sleeve__result">设计地图、整幢与测绘核对原型。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/edgecase-planner/" aria-describedby="work-summary-2" data-select="2" style="--disc: #328bd2" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-2" aria-label="打开 AI 评审工作流案例">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/review-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">03</span><span class="sleeve__title">AI 评审工作流<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-2"><span class="sleeve__type">AI 规则 · 工具实践</span><span class="sleeve__result">把评审经验写成 Plan / Review 规则。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/brand-system/" aria-describedby="work-summary-3" data-select="3" style="--disc: #e6b42e" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-3" aria-label="打开新禾智飞品牌系统提案">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/brand-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">04</span><span class="sleeve__title">新禾智飞品牌系统<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-3"><span class="sleeve__type">品牌视觉 · 提案</span><span class="sleeve__result">设计品牌规范与六个子系统提案。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/execution-query/" aria-describedby="work-summary-4" data-select="4" style="--disc: #36a879" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-4" aria-label="打开执行网查询助手">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/query-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">05</span><span class="sleeve__title">执行网查询助手<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-4"><span class="sleeve__type">查询工具 · 本地实践</span><span class="sleeve__result">独立实现批量查询与三表导出。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/yuejian/" aria-describedby="work-summary-5" data-select="5" style="--disc: #30343A" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-5" aria-label="打开粤见非遗小程序">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/yuejian-overprint.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">06</span><span class="sleeve__title">粤见非遗小程序<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span><span class="sleeve__summary" id="work-summary-5"><span class="sleeve__type">移动端 · 未上线概念</span><span class="sleeve__result">独立设计十一屏原型与纸张动效。</span></span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="panel" aria-label="当前作品介绍">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <div class="sides" role="group" aria-label="切换介绍内容">
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="a" aria-pressed="true">A 面 · 设计思路</button>
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="b" aria-pressed="false">B 面 · 交付与阶段</button>
      </div>
      <p class="panel__keys"><span><button type="button" data-direction="left" aria-label="上一张唱片">←</button><button type="button" data-direction="right" aria-label="下一张唱片">→</button> 选作品</span><span><button type="button" data-direction="up" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↑</button><button type="button" data-direction="down" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↓</button> 切换 A/B 面</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel__body">
      <article class="work" id="work-0" data-work="0" aria-labelledby="work-title-0">
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-0">新禾低空智航运营服务平台</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>把巡查任务、现场判读和区域总览放到各自的工作面。</strong>驾驶舱把实时视频投到地图上，便于巡查人员边看现场，边对照管控范围。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>负责大屏、移动端和后台的界面与交互设计。<strong>阶段：</strong>三端于 2025 年上线。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-1" data-work="1" aria-labelledby="work-title-1" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-1">房产 GIS 体验重构</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>围绕地图找楼、整幢看房、测绘核对三个任务重排界面。</strong>总图把楼幢属性与任务入口放在同一面板，整幢页把主区域留给户室矩阵，核对页把新旧记录与面积差异并列。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>总图、整幢和实测替换预测三个可操作原型。<strong>阶段：</strong>个人回溯重构，使用演示数据。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-2" data-work="2" aria-labelledby="work-title-2" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-2">把设计经验整理成可复用的 AI 工作流</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>把实际评审遇到的问题写成 AI 检查规则。</strong>设计前按任务追问遗漏条件（Plan），设计后对照页面证据核查交互（Review），并用实际操作回查规则。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>九条设计前后检查规则，保留物业投诉、飞行计划与分步表单的检查记录。<strong>阶段：</strong>个人工具实践，随使用反馈修订。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-3" data-work="3" aria-labelledby="work-title-3" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-3">新禾智飞品牌系统提案</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>不同供应商分批制作时，标识和版式各有做法。</strong>我把标识组合、字号层级、色值与留白写进规范，配套可供制作人员查用的物料模板。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>品牌规范和六个子系统的模板与物料提案。<strong>阶段：</strong>新规范与新物料处于提案阶段，设计依据来自已投产的旧物料。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-4" data-work="4" aria-labelledby="work-title-4" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-4">执行网查询助手</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>官网升级验证方式后，我把人工验证留在官网原页</strong>，本地控制台保留队列，验证完成后继续查询，并整理结果供比对和导出。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>本地控制台、任务历史和三表 Excel 导出。<strong>阶段：</strong>2026 年 9 月 12 日用两项合成任务走通查询到导出，后续随官网变化维护。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-5" data-work="5" aria-labelledby="work-title-5" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-5">粤见 · 广府非遗体验小程序</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a"><strong>沿着「看展品、约工坊、收手作」设计移动端体验，用展卷、翻课单与撕票动效交代页面关系和操作结果。</strong></p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden><strong>交付：</strong>十一屏可操作原型、五段动效录像与两页视觉规范。<strong>阶段：</strong>概念产品未上线，界面照片为生成示意图。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="sr-only" data-announcement aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    <noscript><p class="no-script">六个案例可以直接阅读 <a href="/work/low-altitude-operations/">低空智航运营平台</a>、<a href="/work/real-estate-gis/">房产 GIS</a>、<a href="/work/edgecase-planner/">AI 评审</a>、<a href="/work/brand-system/">品牌系统提案</a>、<a href="/work/execution-query/">执行网助手</a>、<a href="/work/yuejian/">粤见非遗小程序</a>。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  </div>
  </div>
  <section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h2 id="about-title">关于</h2>
    <div><p>我有 12 年设计经验，从刊物与品牌视觉转向大屏、后台与移动端产品体验。我用 AI 辅助制作交互原型和查询工具，并把评审经验写成可复用的检查规则。</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="../scripts/turntable.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
